<section data-screen-label="Cost" id="cost" style="background:var(--paper);padding:clamp(56px,7vw,104px) 0;scroll-margin-top:120px">
<div style="width:min(100% - clamp(64px,14vw,128px),1200px);margin-inline:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:clamp(32px,4vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div>
<span style="display:inline-block;margin:0 0 18px;padding-top:14px;border-top:2px solid var(--sand-500);font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:var(--ls-eyebrow);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sand-700)">Pricing</span>
<h2 style="margin:0;font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(31px,3.9vw,52px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--ink-950)">How Much Does Knee Stem Cell Therapy Cost?</h2>
<p style="margin:22px 0 0;max-width:56ch;font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">There is no single meaningful price because the products and protocols can be fundamentally different.</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0 18px;max-width:60ch;font-size:17px;line-height:1.72;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Cost can vary by country, cell source, processing, dose, one or both knees, imaging, laboratory work, physician procedure, additional biologics and follow-up.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;max-width:60ch;font-size:17px;line-height:1.72;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)"><strong>The first question should not be “Which clinic is cheaper?” It should be “Am I comparing equivalent protocols?”</strong></p>
<p style="margin:0;max-width:60ch;font-size:17px;line-height:1.72;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">For a deeper pricing comparison, use the <a href="/stem-cell-therapy-cost-estimator" style="text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px">STEMCIERGE Stem Cell Therapy Cost Estimator</a>, built from the STEMCIERGE Global Pricing Review.</p>
<div style="margin-top:26px">
<a href="/stem-cell-therapy-cost-estimator" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:var(--ls-wide);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--link-on-light);padding:14px 2px">Compare Treatment Costs <span>→</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<aside style="background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--line-on-light);border-radius:8px;padding:clamp(26px,3vw,34px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card-light)">
<span style="display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:var(--ls-eyebrow);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sand-700);margin-bottom:18px">What changes the quote?</span>
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-on-light)"><span style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Cell product</span><strong style="font-size:14px;text-align:right;color:var(--ink-950)">BMAC / MSC / donor / other</strong></div>
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-on-light)"><span style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Processing</span><strong style="font-size:14px;text-align:right;color:var(--ink-950)">same-day vs expanded</strong></div>
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-on-light)"><span style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Treatment area</span><strong style="font-size:14px;text-align:right;color:var(--ink-950)">one vs both knees</strong></div>
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-on-light)"><span style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Additional biologics</span><strong style="font-size:14px;text-align:right;color:var(--ink-950)">PRP / adjunct protocols</strong></div>
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-on-light)"><span style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Destination</span><strong style="font-size:14px;text-align:right;color:var(--ink-950)">local vs international care</strong></div>
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line-on-light)"><span style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Follow-up</span><strong style="font-size:14px;text-align:right;color:var(--ink-950)">what is actually included</strong></div>
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-on-light-muted)">Pricing is planning information, not a medical quote.</p>
</aside>
</div>
</section>
<section data-screen-label="Treatment abroad" id="abroad" style="background:var(--white);border-top:1px solid var(--line-on-light);padding:clamp(56px,7vw,104px) 0;scroll-margin-top:120px">
<div style="width:min(100% - clamp(64px,14vw,128px),1200px);margin-inline:auto">
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:clamp(32px,4vw,64px);align-items:start;margin-bottom:clamp(36px,4vw,56px)">
<div>
<span style="display:inline-block;margin:0 0 18px;padding-top:14px;border-top:2px solid var(--sand-500);font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:var(--ls-eyebrow);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sand-700)">Treatment abroad</span>
<h2 style="margin:0;font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(31px,3.9vw,52px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--ink-950)">Considering Knee Stem Cell Therapy Abroad?</h2>
</div>
<div>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;max-width:64ch;font-size:17px;line-height:1.72;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">Different countries may offer different products, regulatory pathways, prices and models of care. Choosing the destination before understanding the treatment is backwards.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;max-width:64ch;font-size:17px;line-height:1.72;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)"><strong>A better sequence is: your knee → reasonable options → appropriate providers → destination.</strong></p>
<p style="margin:0;max-width:64ch;font-size:17px;line-height:1.72;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">For example, some international patients compare options in <a href="/thailand" style="text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px">Thailand</a> because of treatment availability, travel logistics and cost. The same destination will not make sense for every patient or every protocol.</p>
</div>
</div>
