<article style="border-top:1px solid var(--ink-950);padding:22px 0 0">
<h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:var(--font-subhead);font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-950)">Product</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--text-on-light-secondary)">What biological intervention is actually available in that country?</p>
</article>
