<span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;white-space:nowrap;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:var(--radius-pill);background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line-on-light);font-family:var(--font-subhead);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-950)"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokelinecap="round" strokelinejoin="round" strokewidth="1.5" style="width:16px;height:16px;flex:0 0 auto;color:var(--sand-700)" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 4v6a3 3 0 0 0 3 3h9"></path><path d="M6 20v-3"></path><path d="m15 10 3 3-3 3"></path></svg>Reasonable options</span><span style="color:var(--text-on-light-muted)">→</span></span>
