<h2 style="margin:0 0 clamp(32px,4vw,44px);max-width:26ch;font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(31px,3.9vw,52px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--ink-950)">What We Know, and What We Still Don't Know</h2>
